---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const appRefreshLink = 'retail://stripe-connect-refresh';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Continue Payout Setup | ReTail"
  description="Continue Stripe payout setup for your ReTail seller account."
  path="/stripe-connect-refresh"
  noindex
>
  <section class="section page-hero narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Payout setup</span>
    <h1>Continue payout setup</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your secure Stripe setup link needs to be refreshed. Open ReTail and tap Continue Payout Setup to get a new secure Stripe link.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={appRefreshLink}>Open ReTail</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/contact">Contact Support</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section narrow policy-body">
    <section>
      <h2>Need a new setup link?</h2>
      <p>Stripe setup links expire for security. ReTail creates a fresh link from inside the app after checking your current payout status.</p>
      <p>Open ReTail manually if the button does not launch the app, then go to Profile, Settings, and Payments &amp; Payouts.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
